<node id="Thailand">
  <data key="d0">Thailand</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Thailand is a country in Southeast Asia, hosting both Samut Prakan and the Mae Moh power station.&lt;SEP&gt;Thailand is the country where the research institutions and power plants involved in the study are located.</data>
