  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Mae Moh power station, located in Lampang, Thailand, is a power plant that provided the fly ash used in the preparation of geopolymers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad60afc1fc1390582346359c09ae89a7</data>
