  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Ajax Chemical Co., Ltd. is a company based in Samut Prakan, Thailand, supplying sulfur for commercial use.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajax Chemical Co., Ltd., located in Samut Prakan, Thailand, supplied sulfur used in the rubber formulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9f812eeaa3c93f5c4d945e0ae7c91d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad60afc1fc1390582346359c09ae89a7</data>
