  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Lampang is a location in Thailand where the Mae Moh power station is situated and from which fly ash was sourced.&lt;SEP&gt;Lampang is a location in Thailand where the Mae Moh power station is situated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9f812eeaa3c93f5c4d945e0ae7c91d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad60afc1fc1390582346359c09ae89a7</data>
