  <data key="d2">Samut Prakan is a location in Thailand where Ajax Chemical Co., Ltd. is based.&lt;SEP&gt;Samut Prakan is a location in Thailand where Global Chemical Co., Ltd. and Ajax Chemical Co., Ltd. are based and supplied materials for the experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9f812eeaa3c93f5c4d945e0ae7c91d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad60afc1fc1390582346359c09ae89a7</data>
