  <data key="d2">Charon Tut Co., LTD. is a company based in Bangkok, Thailand, that manufactured the electrically heated plate press (model PR1D-W400L450PM) used for vulcanizing compounds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee381638b4e2088dd8f91df9d74e6da7</data>
