<edge source="Geopolymer" target="Mullite">
  <data key="d6">18.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Mullite is added to geopolymer to improve mechanical properties and microstructure, with 40 wt% being optimal.&lt;SEP&gt;Mullite is added to the geopolymer mixture to modify its physical properties, particularly reducing initial and final setting times.</data>
  <data key="d8">composite reinforcement,material modification,microstructure modification,property enhancement</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-ab8d7ecaf50775e77f92ac39831ef997&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ff7939cdf3c7690a9b0936aae778017</data>
