<edge source="Geopolymer" target="Geopolymerization">
  <data key="d6">20.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Geopolymerization is the process that produces geopolymer from fly ash and alkaline activators.&lt;SEP&gt;The shift in the main FTIR band at 1,086 cm⁻¹ and the presence of Si-O-T bonds indicate the extent and kinetics of geopolymerization reactions in the geopolymer.</data>
  <data key="d8">material formation,process-product,reaction monitoring,synthesis</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-5e2d2a2aac672793717ce07dc518653a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b41c1604bb36ddf18d8b7e29a9c6dbe</data>
