  <data key="d11">1754208693</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Geopolymer" target="Silanol Groups">
  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Two small bands at 1,625 cm⁻¹ and 3,452 cm⁻¹ in the geopolymer spectrum correspond to silanol group vibrations and hydrogen bonding with water.</data>
